### Download audio
# @name downloadAudio
POST {{baseurl}}/videos/audio
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PC5JnGHQNU"
}

### transcribe video
# @name transcribeVideo
POST {{baseurl}}/videos/transcribe
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0CmtDk-joT4"
